WEBVTT

01:47.520 --> 01:49.440
The Huben Army's ambush

01:49.520 --> 01:51.400
caused Chang'an to fall.

01:52.080 --> 01:54.400
The Emperor, Xiao Wuyang, was attacked

01:54.480 --> 01:56.240
and went missing.

01:56.760 --> 02:00.400
Yan Fengshan rules Chang'an once again.

02:18.280 --> 02:20.600
Master, is this the only way
out of the city?

02:21.280 --> 02:22.320
Yes.

02:23.200 --> 02:25.720
A few thousand people were mobilized
from Hidden Soldier Alley.

02:25.800 --> 02:28.000
They mainly handle court secrets
and the city gates.

02:29.200 --> 02:32.000
The canal is remote
so there is still a chance.

02:32.840 --> 02:34.680
People say that Your Majesty

02:34.760 --> 02:37.120
is kind in heart yet lacking in talent.

02:37.200 --> 02:39.400
You ascended the throne
only to govern in mediocrity.

02:40.000 --> 02:43.040
You brought war back upon the land
and left the common people in misery.

02:43.120 --> 02:46.120
They also added that, in the end,
you had let your ancestors down

02:46.720 --> 02:48.120
and perished in disgrace.

02:48.720 --> 02:50.080
But I beg to differ.

02:51.160 --> 02:52.920
I have heard that
under Your Majesty's leadership,

02:53.000 --> 02:54.400
you granted the people time to recover

02:54.480 --> 02:56.360
and returned the troops to their barracks.

02:56.440 --> 02:57.560
You reshaped customs

02:57.640 --> 02:59.560
and brought prosperity to all.

03:00.080 --> 03:01.360
The elderly had someone to rely on

03:01.440 --> 03:03.800
and the children had someone
to raise them.

03:04.480 --> 03:05.800
Though your reign

03:05.880 --> 03:08.400
lacked both the fierce valor
of your late father

03:08.480 --> 03:10.320
and the martial might
of the Marquis of Northguard,

03:10.840 --> 03:14.160
you held compassion for the common folk,

03:14.240 --> 03:17.360
and cared for the livelihood of the poor.

03:18.560 --> 03:20.640
With such devotion to the state
and its people,

03:20.720 --> 03:22.160
you are not at fault.

03:22.680 --> 03:24.160
They called you a scoundrel

03:24.240 --> 03:25.560
whose disorderly governance

03:25.640 --> 03:27.720
caused the northern army to rise
and seize the throne by force.

03:28.920 --> 03:31.600
The court cowered in trepidation
and the martial world grew disheartened.

03:31.680 --> 03:33.400
Fear stirred resentment

03:33.480 --> 03:35.240
and bitterness took root
against Your Majesty.

03:36.160 --> 03:39.800
While Your Majesty
might have lost your throne

03:39.880 --> 03:41.440
and is wandering the world aimlessly,

03:42.320 --> 03:45.720
your devotion shouldn't be confined
only to the palace walls.

03:46.440 --> 03:48.120
Even far from the center of power,

03:48.200 --> 03:49.680
you may still accomplish much.

03:50.320 --> 03:51.600
In this life,

03:52.920 --> 03:54.880
I fear I will have no chance
to see Your Majesty again.

03:55.560 --> 03:57.040
I pray only that Your Majesty

03:57.120 --> 03:59.400
does not forget your first intent…

03:59.480 --> 04:00.320
FROM HAN ZILING

04:00.400 --> 04:03.760
…for one day it will be heard
somewhere in the world.

04:05.360 --> 04:07.440
So your name was Han Ziling.

04:58.960 --> 05:00.480
For some reason,

05:02.960 --> 05:05.840
the gates of the Imperial Jail are open.

05:07.000 --> 05:08.800
I guess

05:09.960 --> 05:13.200
White Hair has fulfilled his promise.

05:13.800 --> 05:15.600
You've been sitting for a few decades.

05:18.440 --> 05:20.080
You can finally stand up now.

05:22.160 --> 05:25.280
I no longer have the right to sit.

05:29.400 --> 05:33.040
To save you,

05:33.640 --> 05:35.880
I hid the fact

05:36.800 --> 05:39.480
that White Hair
was in Hidden Soldier Alley.

05:43.880 --> 05:47.800
This is unfair

05:49.120 --> 05:50.880
to the Huben Army.

05:51.760 --> 05:53.120
To protect myself,

05:55.160 --> 05:58.000
I even gave away
the Huben Army's gold coin.

06:00.240 --> 06:02.280
This is also a form of betrayal.

06:13.800 --> 06:14.920
Mother,

06:16.040 --> 06:18.280
like mother, like son indeed.

06:20.280 --> 06:21.680
Right now,

06:22.400 --> 06:24.000
the Huben Army

06:25.880 --> 06:28.280
no longer has anything to do with me.

06:31.400 --> 06:32.400
I think

06:33.840 --> 06:35.400
I should leave.

06:38.280 --> 06:40.080
I should have

06:42.400 --> 06:43.600
left sooner.

07:30.000 --> 07:33.960
ONE MONTH LATER

09:09.360 --> 09:11.960
Hot lamb soup!

09:12.720 --> 09:14.480
-Come inside.
-Come in.

09:14.560 --> 09:16.440
-Yes.
-Two?

09:16.520 --> 09:19.080
-Sir, sit down.
-It's fresh.

09:19.160 --> 09:20.800
-More vegetables.
-It's delicious.

09:20.880 --> 09:23.400
-Sure.
-It's so fresh.

09:25.040 --> 09:26.160
Give me some.

09:26.240 --> 09:28.560
Here.

09:31.720 --> 09:32.880
Sure. Let me pack it for you.

09:32.960 --> 09:34.840
-Who are you?
-It's me.

09:34.920 --> 09:35.800
Don't you remember me?

09:35.880 --> 09:37.880
‎HOUSE SAUCES

09:37.960 --> 09:38.800
Little runt, right?

09:38.880 --> 09:40.000
You are a little runt.

09:41.200 --> 09:42.360
Indeed.

09:42.440 --> 09:44.040
I don't know who my parents are.

09:44.560 --> 09:46.320
Perhaps I'm someone no one wants.

09:47.520 --> 09:49.880
Come and have a look.

09:50.960 --> 09:51.800
I was just kidding.

09:51.880 --> 09:53.520
Give me two jin of pork shoulder.

09:53.600 --> 09:55.840
My mother's making
stuffed flatbread tonight.

09:56.720 --> 09:57.840
Oh, it's you.

09:57.920 --> 09:59.000
Why not get some?

09:59.080 --> 10:01.200
I'm sorry. I can't help you this time.

10:01.280 --> 10:02.160
Why?

10:02.760 --> 10:05.600
Didn't you go to the butcher's shop
to chop some meat for me last time?

10:06.120 --> 10:07.880
That was the last time.
This time, it's different.

10:08.480 --> 10:09.640
How so?

10:09.720 --> 10:10.720
I'm different.

10:10.800 --> 10:13.080
You still look the same.

10:19.040 --> 10:19.880
Did you commit a crime?

10:21.160 --> 10:22.000
A huge crime.

10:22.080 --> 10:24.720
Then, can you still go home and eat?

10:26.000 --> 10:27.080
I guess.

10:29.440 --> 10:30.600
However, I'm different.

10:32.000 --> 10:33.160
I have to earn

10:34.480 --> 10:36.040
my own meal.

10:36.120 --> 10:37.680
That is why it's so meaningful.

10:56.280 --> 10:58.400
General, dinner is ready.

10:58.480 --> 10:59.960
Let's wait for Wang Pu.

11:00.480 --> 11:01.680
He has gone to the market.

11:02.640 --> 11:04.960
He'll be slow with shackles on his feet.

11:06.360 --> 11:07.200
You may go back first.

11:09.640 --> 11:10.480
One more thing.

11:10.560 --> 11:12.680
Secret envoys of Tiemo have departed.

11:12.760 --> 11:14.840
Yang Chuhao
is in charge of taking care of them.

11:17.520 --> 11:19.080
The Tiemo people are coming.

11:19.160 --> 11:22.240
White Hair should also be appearing soon.

11:23.640 --> 11:25.800
He won't let go of this opportunity.

11:27.480 --> 11:30.360
Tell Yang Chuhao's men
to keep a close eye on it.

11:30.440 --> 11:31.760
Yes.

11:36.600 --> 11:38.960
Why hasn't Wang Pu come back?

11:39.880 --> 11:41.760
I'll go and pick him up from the market.

11:43.000 --> 11:44.600
You spoil him, General.

11:45.280 --> 11:47.520
I captured Chang'an

11:47.600 --> 11:49.400
but I didn't sit on the throne
at Taiqing Hall.

11:49.920 --> 11:51.640
I moved to the market instead.

11:52.400 --> 11:56.400
But eating alone makes me feel lonely.

12:00.720 --> 12:01.720
I'm closing up.

12:01.800 --> 12:03.680
-The radish is nice.
-Do you have something larger?

12:06.920 --> 12:08.720
-They are different.
-That's great.

12:08.800 --> 12:10.120
Very good.

12:10.720 --> 12:11.800
-I'll take two.
-Sure.

12:12.320 --> 12:13.720
Give me a discount.

12:17.480 --> 12:18.600
I want more.

12:20.480 --> 12:21.520
-General.
-General.

12:22.720 --> 12:24.240
-General.
-General.

12:24.320 --> 12:25.720
Keep drinking.

12:27.160 --> 12:28.120
All of you may leave.

12:28.800 --> 12:31.040
I have something to say to Mr. Wang Pu.

12:31.120 --> 12:32.040
-Yes.
-Yes.

12:45.760 --> 12:47.520
When you're upset,

12:48.280 --> 12:49.840
drinking makes you inebriated faster.

12:51.480 --> 12:53.320
I dare not act recklessly before you.

12:53.400 --> 12:55.480
You've acted recklessly many times.

12:56.760 --> 12:59.400
Zhiying cooks for us every day.

12:59.480 --> 13:01.000
She never complains,

13:01.080 --> 13:02.480
yet you will not accept her kindness.

13:03.080 --> 13:04.360
I'm not refusing her kindness.

13:06.320 --> 13:08.200
I feel too guilty to eat.

13:09.720 --> 13:11.360
Do you feel no guilt

13:11.440 --> 13:14.120
eating meat and drinking wine
in this eatery, then?

13:14.720 --> 13:17.080
Back in Hidden Soldier Alley,
I gave him plenty of favors.

13:17.160 --> 13:18.480
Of course, I don't feel guilty.

13:19.080 --> 13:20.000
On the contrary,

13:20.080 --> 13:22.640
I failed to solve your problem

13:22.720 --> 13:24.080
and nearly cost you your life.

13:24.600 --> 13:25.880
I feel guilty.

13:28.360 --> 13:29.760
You won't win against White Hair.

13:30.880 --> 13:33.240
I might not even be able to do it either.

13:36.200 --> 13:38.040
Zhiying said I spoiled you.

13:38.120 --> 13:41.120
I don't treat you
like a general treats his subordinates.

13:43.200 --> 13:45.200
However, you served me
since you were young.

13:45.800 --> 13:48.480
I've never regarded you as my subordinate.

13:49.000 --> 13:50.880
If a subordinate makes a mistake

13:50.960 --> 13:52.360
and I kill him,

13:52.880 --> 13:55.720
many more people are available
to obey my command.

13:56.680 --> 13:58.360
When you make a mistake

13:58.880 --> 14:00.600
and don't come home to eat,

14:00.680 --> 14:02.600
I come out to find you.

14:03.120 --> 14:04.640
I endure the night breeze,

14:05.160 --> 14:07.080
as though looking for my own child.

14:20.600 --> 14:22.000
It's time to go back.

14:33.560 --> 14:35.960
-You're paying for real?
-Of course.

14:36.560 --> 14:39.360
I won't kill you
just because you charged me.

14:45.120 --> 14:46.000
Look.

14:46.720 --> 14:47.880
The reward is quite high.

14:47.960 --> 14:49.200
I know, right?

14:50.800 --> 14:51.640
Have you seen this man?

14:52.520 --> 14:54.280
If I'd seen him, I would've…

14:56.240 --> 14:57.600
Let's go.

15:03.080 --> 15:05.560
WARRANT

15:14.160 --> 15:15.800
It does not resemble him.

15:23.920 --> 15:25.240
Master, I'm back.

15:28.720 --> 15:29.840
It's time to go back.

15:29.920 --> 15:31.320
It's going to rain soon.

15:32.920 --> 15:34.320
We're going back when I just arrived?

15:35.000 --> 15:36.720
Let's rest for a while longer.

15:36.800 --> 15:38.120
The air is good here,

15:38.200 --> 15:40.200
unlike the gloomy
and depressing Cangshui River.

15:40.280 --> 15:41.480
It's stuffy there.

15:50.080 --> 15:51.000
Master,

15:51.080 --> 15:54.000
what is the tale behind Cangshui River?

15:54.080 --> 15:56.480
I've been keeping watch from inside
for a few days.

15:56.560 --> 15:58.640
And I noticed some suspicious people.

16:00.800 --> 16:02.560
You are always keeping an eye on others.

16:02.640 --> 16:04.800
They will think
you are the suspicious one too.

16:05.400 --> 16:06.600
I have to do that.

16:06.680 --> 16:09.000
You know who I'm protecting.

16:09.080 --> 16:11.160
Huai'an's father, Liu Ziwen,

16:11.240 --> 16:12.760
is a rare talent.

16:13.360 --> 16:15.320
He spent his whole life

16:15.840 --> 16:17.480
protecting Chang'an.

16:18.120 --> 16:21.240
Hidden Soldier Alley
is the last line of defense.

16:21.960 --> 16:24.520
When it fails and Chang'an falls,

16:24.600 --> 16:26.720
the people and the government

16:26.800 --> 16:28.760
have to move to Cangshui River.

16:28.840 --> 16:32.320
Unfortunately,
before Cangshui River was built,

16:33.520 --> 16:35.200
he was killed.

16:36.360 --> 16:38.320
Does Yan Fengshan know about this place?

16:38.400 --> 16:40.720
Or is there anyone in the Huben Army
who knows about this?

16:40.800 --> 16:43.400
I am the manager of Cangshui River.

16:43.480 --> 16:44.960
Do you think I'm foolish enough

16:45.040 --> 16:47.000
to let Yan Fengshan
and the others know about it?

16:48.040 --> 16:49.840
I know you are the manager.

16:49.920 --> 16:51.440
Aren't we just having a friendly chat?

16:52.040 --> 16:53.280
Moreover,

16:53.360 --> 16:55.880
looking at you now,
you are just a boatman at most.

16:56.480 --> 16:59.080
I manage everything from this boat.

16:59.840 --> 17:01.240
You can only reach Cangshui River

17:01.320 --> 17:04.960
on this boat using this river.

17:05.599 --> 17:09.079
Cangshui River only houses refugees now.

17:09.160 --> 17:10.680
All of them have their lips sealed.

17:11.400 --> 17:13.119
No need to be wary of them.

17:13.960 --> 17:15.160
All right.

17:15.240 --> 17:16.560
With you as the manager,

17:16.640 --> 17:17.640
I'm relieved.

17:29.360 --> 17:30.560
I'm leaving.

17:30.640 --> 17:32.120
Take care. Go on.

17:46.320 --> 17:47.280
Just leave it here.

17:47.360 --> 17:48.280
Yes.

17:48.360 --> 17:50.520
-Give it to me.
-No.

17:50.600 --> 17:51.680
-Your salary.
-It's my turn.

17:51.760 --> 17:53.080
-Pile them up.
-Just hold it.

17:55.920 --> 17:58.160
-How many doses of this?
-Weigh your herbs first.

17:58.240 --> 17:59.480
Slow down.

18:45.360 --> 18:46.520
Sir!

18:47.760 --> 18:49.040
I'm done moving the goods.

18:52.240 --> 18:53.520
You've worked hard.

18:54.480 --> 18:57.320
Young men are indeed strong.

18:57.400 --> 18:58.800
With you around,

18:59.400 --> 19:00.640
I can take it easy.

19:06.400 --> 19:07.520
Sir,

19:08.360 --> 19:09.680
have you noticed

19:09.760 --> 19:12.720
someone looking at the shop all the time?

19:13.240 --> 19:15.880
They are just staring
from right outside the shop.

19:16.600 --> 19:19.560
Although they don't stand there for long,

19:20.160 --> 19:21.440
do you think

19:21.520 --> 19:23.560
there's something in this shop
that attracts attention?

19:23.640 --> 19:24.760
Young man,

19:27.080 --> 19:29.360
how long have you been working here?

19:31.360 --> 19:32.920
I've been here for quite some time.

19:33.520 --> 19:35.680
I was working in other shops

19:35.760 --> 19:37.200
and you were hiring.

19:37.280 --> 19:40.080
I came here because you paid more.

19:41.480 --> 19:42.320
You are lying.

19:43.400 --> 19:44.360
I…

19:44.880 --> 19:46.520
I'm not lying.

19:46.600 --> 19:47.680
It's all right.

19:48.360 --> 19:51.720
Everyone who comes here
is a person in misfortune.

19:52.320 --> 19:53.720
Everyone has it tough.

19:54.440 --> 19:57.960
It's normal to keep everything
to yourself.

19:58.600 --> 20:03.000
I'm sure that you just arrived
at Cangshui River.

20:04.560 --> 20:07.160
Why don't you tell me

20:07.240 --> 20:09.200
what time it is now?

20:16.480 --> 20:18.000
They are here

20:20.280 --> 20:22.040
to look at this.

20:25.680 --> 20:26.920
Okay.

20:28.160 --> 20:29.440
Along the streets,

20:29.520 --> 20:32.400
there are many of these.

20:34.000 --> 20:37.520
I wonder which smart guy invented this.

20:37.600 --> 20:40.200
Anyway, when I acquired this shop,

20:40.280 --> 20:41.120
it was already here.

20:41.800 --> 20:42.680
That's right.

20:42.760 --> 20:43.880
From tomorrow onward,

20:43.960 --> 20:45.880
you must scoop up the salt that leaks out

20:45.960 --> 20:47.360
and pour it back in.

20:47.440 --> 20:49.680
But I still need to move the goods.

20:49.760 --> 20:51.560
Not anymore. Just watch the shop for me.

20:52.160 --> 20:53.280
Really?

20:55.440 --> 20:56.480
Tomorrow.

20:57.240 --> 20:58.880
Sure!

20:58.960 --> 21:02.040
My back is sore
from moving the goods every day.

21:02.120 --> 21:03.320
My shoulders are sore.

21:04.520 --> 21:07.600
You seem too delicate.

21:07.680 --> 21:09.840
You must once have been of noble birth.

21:17.360 --> 21:18.800
But I don't have a noble's fate.

21:21.680 --> 21:23.000
I was just a pageboy.

21:25.400 --> 21:26.760
A pageboy?

21:33.080 --> 21:35.440
I'll get it again when I finish it.

21:35.520 --> 21:36.400
Take a look.

21:37.120 --> 21:38.200
Here you go.

21:38.280 --> 21:39.320
Look at my chicken.

21:39.400 --> 21:40.720
-How many doses…
-Give me a discount…

21:40.800 --> 21:42.320
-…a day?
-…sir.

21:42.400 --> 21:44.160
Weigh your medicine first.

21:44.960 --> 21:46.280
This is far too dear.

23:50.440 --> 23:51.720
You're back?

23:52.960 --> 23:54.240
How's your brother?

23:57.400 --> 23:58.240
Just like that.

24:02.000 --> 24:03.760
I worked many jobs

24:03.840 --> 24:05.240
and I still can't make a lot of money.

24:07.760 --> 24:08.600
This is tough.

24:08.680 --> 24:11.560
A few days in and you're already
complaining.

24:11.640 --> 24:12.800
Listen.

24:12.880 --> 24:14.080
This is life.

24:15.360 --> 24:16.480
Life?

24:17.760 --> 24:19.480
Life also demands…

24:23.240 --> 24:25.760
That's right. Starting tomorrow,

24:25.840 --> 24:27.200
I'll be taking care of the salt shop.

24:27.280 --> 24:29.560
Someone needs to move the goods.

24:29.640 --> 24:30.480
If you go there,

24:30.560 --> 24:31.400
we'll have two people

24:31.480 --> 24:34.080
working two jobs and earning two salaries.

24:35.080 --> 24:36.080
Good idea.

24:36.800 --> 24:38.960
Working two jobs and earning two salaries.

24:39.040 --> 24:40.480
We may even afford wine.

24:40.560 --> 24:41.560
As expected of you.

24:42.800 --> 24:43.920
No, thanks.

24:48.320 --> 24:50.200
Who was the one who said

24:50.880 --> 24:52.440
this was life just now?

24:54.360 --> 24:57.080
I said that was your life.

24:57.680 --> 24:58.920
I don't like your job

24:59.000 --> 25:01.240
and you can't do my job.

25:07.720 --> 25:09.760
I wonder how Huai'an is doing now.

25:16.080 --> 25:17.280
XUANDU TEMPLE

25:17.360 --> 25:19.400
If you hadn't been transferred
out of Chang'an,

25:19.480 --> 25:22.320
we wouldn't have this opportunity
to have tea so casually.

25:22.400 --> 25:24.120
Yet coming here

25:24.640 --> 25:26.520
only fills me with disappointment.

25:26.600 --> 25:28.520
You've been in Chang'an for so many years.

25:28.600 --> 25:29.920
Don't you have any other ways?

25:30.000 --> 25:31.560
Ways?

25:31.640 --> 25:34.200
After Yan Fengshan captured Chang'an,

25:35.080 --> 25:36.440
the whole situation changed.

25:37.080 --> 25:38.320
What ways do I have?

25:39.480 --> 25:40.320
‎AWAKEN TO THE TRUE WAY

25:40.400 --> 25:43.360
But I heard nothing has changed
in the imperial court.

25:43.440 --> 25:46.480
General Fengshan
doesn't even enter Taiqing Hall.

25:46.560 --> 25:48.520
He even brought someone
from the Xiao imperial family

25:48.600 --> 25:49.600
to be the Emperor

25:50.120 --> 25:52.560
to preserve the legitimacy
of the Xiao dynasty.

25:58.800 --> 26:01.600
Do you really think that the young emperor

26:02.560 --> 26:03.720
is from the Xiao family?

26:04.960 --> 26:07.040
Whether I believe in it or not
isn't important.

26:07.640 --> 26:08.560
The important thing

26:08.640 --> 26:11.480
is when you can be transferred
back to Chang'an.

26:16.200 --> 26:17.600
I'll be honest with you.

26:17.680 --> 26:19.200
On the surface,

26:19.280 --> 26:21.520
I was only an Imperial Guard.

26:22.400 --> 26:23.640
In truth,

26:24.320 --> 26:25.680
I was actually serving Chancellor Gao.

26:27.160 --> 26:30.400
Now, Chancellor Gao
is doing worse than I am.

26:31.440 --> 26:34.520
What makes you think
I can make a comeback again?

26:34.600 --> 26:37.560
Nothing is absolute in life.

26:38.160 --> 26:39.520
It's full of ups and downs.

26:39.600 --> 26:41.080
Don't dwell on it.

26:41.160 --> 26:43.680
When your next wave of fortune comes,

26:43.760 --> 26:46.840
you might even go to further heights.

26:51.680 --> 26:54.400
If your temple had more devotees,

26:54.480 --> 26:56.440
I might believe you a little more.

26:56.520 --> 26:57.720
Look at it now.

26:58.800 --> 27:00.400
It sees more flies than devotees.

27:01.680 --> 27:02.600
It's not a popular area.

27:02.680 --> 27:03.760
It's not a popular area.

27:04.600 --> 27:05.760
Enough.

27:05.840 --> 27:07.120
Just stay here.

27:07.680 --> 27:09.200
When I come here tomorrow,

27:09.280 --> 27:11.120
I'll get another cup of tea.

27:12.920 --> 27:14.240
-Take care.
-Farewell.

27:14.320 --> 27:19.400
XUANDU TEMPLE

27:25.240 --> 27:28.400
LIVE BY NATURE'S WAY

27:35.840 --> 27:39.000
Zeng, the wind rises.

27:40.240 --> 27:42.160
Remember to sleep with an extra blanket.

27:42.240 --> 27:43.200
Yes.

27:44.480 --> 27:45.760
It's getting windy.

27:46.680 --> 27:47.880
No need to worry about me.

27:48.520 --> 27:50.480
I can protect myself.

27:50.560 --> 27:53.400
Thank you for guarding the temple.

27:53.480 --> 27:55.040
I was able to go home for a few nights.

27:55.920 --> 27:58.680
If you need anything, just tell me.

27:58.760 --> 28:00.200
Don't stand on ceremony.

28:00.800 --> 28:02.040
Thank you for taking me in.

28:02.920 --> 28:04.600
You will be blessed for your kindness.

28:07.560 --> 28:12.080
XUANDU TEMPLE

28:41.520 --> 28:42.640
You're here.

28:43.840 --> 28:45.280
It has been a long time.

28:47.080 --> 28:49.240
However, this move is too dangerous.

28:50.280 --> 28:51.120
Last time,

28:52.760 --> 28:54.160
we lost badly.

29:03.200 --> 29:04.560
A visitor this late at night?

29:04.640 --> 29:06.240
An acquaintance came to visit.

29:06.760 --> 29:08.040
We exchanged a few words.

29:09.160 --> 29:10.360
I see.

29:10.960 --> 29:12.720
I've returned to retrieve some lamp oil.

29:35.920 --> 29:36.920
Has your friend left?

29:37.520 --> 29:38.440
He has.

29:38.960 --> 29:39.920
He left in a hurry.

29:40.840 --> 29:43.120
You look very tired.

29:43.640 --> 29:45.080
You must rest more.

29:46.160 --> 29:47.440
Sure.

30:30.080 --> 30:31.120
Give me more time.

30:33.800 --> 30:36.360
I will soon give you an explanation.

30:36.960 --> 30:38.040
Liu Zhi,

30:39.160 --> 30:40.600
I don't need an explanation.

30:42.720 --> 30:43.880
I just want you

30:45.880 --> 30:47.400
to live on.

31:06.560 --> 31:07.800
Live on?

31:12.400 --> 31:13.920
What meaning is there in living?

31:21.560 --> 31:23.920
CHANGLE OUTPOST

31:50.520 --> 31:51.360
Sir,

31:51.960 --> 31:54.640
instead of sleeping at night,
you stare at this warrant.

31:54.720 --> 31:55.760
WARRANT

31:55.840 --> 31:57.040
Do you know him?

31:57.120 --> 31:59.520
Your opportunity to return to Chang'an
is here.

32:05.240 --> 32:06.440
It's the middle of the night.

32:07.160 --> 32:08.160
Don't try to fool me.

32:08.760 --> 32:11.560
Last month, gave someone shelter.

32:12.400 --> 32:13.600
He said his name was Zeng.

32:14.320 --> 32:16.240
He came to Chang'an to do business

32:16.320 --> 32:17.600
and all his money was scammed.

32:18.200 --> 32:20.960
He asked for a place to stay.

32:21.040 --> 32:23.400
I told him to work at the temple
as a night guard

32:23.480 --> 32:26.280
so that I can sneak out

32:26.360 --> 32:28.560
at night to gamble.

32:30.680 --> 32:31.760
Sir,

32:32.440 --> 32:34.000
do you know how much you have lost?

32:34.600 --> 32:36.680
Why persist in gambling?

32:38.120 --> 32:39.320
But now,

32:39.840 --> 32:44.000
I think he looks like this person.

32:48.320 --> 32:49.280
Last month?

32:50.800 --> 32:52.160
Why didn't you say it sooner?

32:52.240 --> 32:56.000
Is your vision so bad
that you only noticed yesterday?

32:56.080 --> 32:57.600
Of course not.

32:58.120 --> 32:59.640
I recognized him long ago

33:00.440 --> 33:03.760
but I also heard about what he did
in Chang'an back then.

33:03.840 --> 33:06.840
He is the man chosen by Xiao Wuyang.

33:07.640 --> 33:09.640
I need to determine
what the right thing to do is.

33:09.720 --> 33:10.880
In the future,

33:10.960 --> 33:13.160
if Xiao Wuyang rises again,

33:13.680 --> 33:16.760
then I shouldn't
offend this person as well.

33:17.640 --> 33:19.160
How unexpected.

33:20.560 --> 33:22.480
You are more shrewd than I expected.

33:22.560 --> 33:26.640
Today, he looked all dazed

33:26.720 --> 33:29.320
like he was talking to ghosts.

33:29.400 --> 33:31.480
He has no future left.

33:32.080 --> 33:34.520
It's better to turn him in

33:35.120 --> 33:37.040
and make us both rich.

33:37.800 --> 33:39.360
We'll get 1,000 liang of silver.

33:39.440 --> 33:41.680
You can take the credit.

33:43.200 --> 33:46.600
But I have been unlucky recently.

33:46.680 --> 33:48.080
Your bad luck must've rubbed off on me.

33:48.680 --> 33:50.360
I even owe a lot of debt.

33:54.120 --> 33:56.000
I just need a way back to the Capital.

33:57.440 --> 33:58.760
You can

34:00.440 --> 34:01.360
take all the reward.

34:08.120 --> 34:13.560
WARRANT

34:13.639 --> 34:15.199
Hot lamb soup!

34:15.280 --> 34:16.679
Move.

34:16.760 --> 34:18.159
Let's go.

34:18.239 --> 34:20.199
-Yes.
-Give me two.

34:20.280 --> 34:21.840
-Sir, take a seat.
-Fresh from the pot.

34:22.440 --> 34:25.280
Vegetables! Come and take a look!

34:30.080 --> 34:32.239
Fresh lamb meat!

34:32.320 --> 34:34.400
Sir, two bowls of mutton.

34:34.480 --> 34:35.639
Sure.

34:41.960 --> 34:43.120
Sir, enjoy.

34:43.199 --> 34:46.000
RICE BALLS, SWEETS, HOUSE SAUCES

34:46.800 --> 34:49.520
-Come and take a look.
-Mom, I want to drink the soup.

34:50.840 --> 34:51.760
Pick it up, quick.

34:51.840 --> 34:53.239
Come and take a look!

34:54.440 --> 34:56.360
Buns!

34:56.440 --> 34:59.240
-Meat buns!
-They are fresh.

34:59.320 --> 35:00.320
They are delicious!

35:00.400 --> 35:01.600
Miss, come.

35:01.680 --> 35:03.360
-How about two?
-Come out and eat some meat.

35:03.440 --> 35:04.560
You've trailed me all morning.

35:10.720 --> 35:12.400
Nothing can be hidden

35:12.480 --> 35:14.640
from you, Mr. Wang.

35:14.720 --> 35:15.800
Let's talk while we eat.

35:16.480 --> 35:19.160
Then I shall help myself.

35:19.760 --> 35:23.360
In the past,
I was an Imperial Guard on the surface

35:23.440 --> 35:25.960
but I was actually serving the chancellor.

35:27.120 --> 35:28.320
Chancellor Gao?

35:29.720 --> 35:30.920
How are his legs?

35:31.000 --> 35:33.240
Worse than yours by far.

35:35.800 --> 35:36.760
Continue.

35:36.840 --> 35:38.920
Xie Huai'an was stabbed previously.

35:39.440 --> 35:42.240
Chancellor Gao ordered me
to protect Xie Huai'an,

35:42.760 --> 35:43.920
Ye Zheng, and Zhang Mo.

35:44.000 --> 35:45.960
I was with them for a few years.

35:46.960 --> 35:49.120
Other people don't recognize them

35:49.800 --> 35:50.920
but I do.

35:52.120 --> 35:53.000
Who did you find?

35:53.960 --> 35:55.040
The Taoist temple outside the city.

35:56.920 --> 35:58.040
Xie Huai'an.

35:59.960 --> 36:01.040
I speak truth.

36:02.760 --> 36:03.800
If I lie to you,

36:04.440 --> 36:07.760
I don't think it'll be difficult
for you to kill me, Mr. Wang.

36:13.720 --> 36:16.280
However, your former master,
Chancellor Gao,

36:17.280 --> 36:18.680
is very protective of Xie Huai'an.

36:24.480 --> 36:25.880
When the ship sinks, everyone jumps.

36:27.760 --> 36:28.920
In recent times,

36:29.520 --> 36:31.920
one's wealth is more important
than one's reputation.

36:32.800 --> 36:34.120
Being loyal is not as practical

36:34.200 --> 36:36.760
as having some lamb meat to eat.

36:44.600 --> 36:45.440
Sir.

36:45.960 --> 36:46.960
Coming.

36:50.480 --> 36:51.800
That's too much.

36:52.400 --> 36:55.120
Buy a knife with the extra change.

37:10.480 --> 37:11.320
Let's go.

37:37.080 --> 37:38.120
Stop.

37:50.920 --> 37:51.960
Mr. Wang Pu.

37:52.040 --> 37:53.000
What's wrong?

38:08.560 --> 38:10.160
The weather is changing.

38:18.320 --> 38:19.880
XUANDU TEMPLE

38:19.960 --> 38:21.480
THE WAY LIVES ON

38:43.800 --> 38:46.000
Just one person?

38:46.080 --> 38:47.000
Shut up.

38:47.600 --> 38:48.640
Do you know who he is?

38:49.240 --> 38:50.480
Mr. Wang Pu

38:50.560 --> 38:53.400
is the most capable person
under General Fengshan.

38:54.520 --> 38:55.960
Apologies for not recognizing you.

38:56.040 --> 38:57.320
Forgive me.

38:57.400 --> 38:59.560
That's enough. Where is he?

39:00.640 --> 39:03.480
He's in the hall at the back.
He said his name was Zeng.

39:03.560 --> 39:05.200
He has been staying here
for about a month.

39:05.920 --> 39:06.760
Don't follow me.

39:07.400 --> 39:08.600
I'll go inside alone.

39:52.400 --> 39:55.840
AWAKENING AND RETURNING TO PURITY

39:55.920 --> 39:56.840
You're here?

39:58.560 --> 39:59.400
Yes.

40:03.520 --> 40:05.280
I'm cooking dumplings.

40:05.360 --> 40:06.400
I made some for you too.

40:07.240 --> 40:09.280
Sure. I'll dine with you.

40:12.600 --> 40:14.320
I know you want to earn merit

40:15.240 --> 40:17.840
and regain your dignity
in front of Yan Fengshan.

40:17.920 --> 40:19.240
Thus,

40:19.760 --> 40:21.680
I asked Commander Wang to lure you here.

40:23.200 --> 40:24.400
He serves me.

40:25.000 --> 40:26.440
I know that.

40:28.200 --> 40:29.240
He plays his part quite well.

40:33.440 --> 40:34.440
Right.

40:35.320 --> 40:37.160
I can't hide it from you for too long.

40:38.760 --> 40:39.880
You're here.

40:40.760 --> 40:42.240
It has been a while.

40:42.320 --> 40:44.920
I've been waiting for you to summon me.

40:45.000 --> 40:47.000
Another move has to be made

40:47.880 --> 40:49.120
to hit back against Yan Fengshan.

40:49.760 --> 40:53.000
I will never forget
what the chancellor did for me.

40:53.080 --> 40:55.360
As long as I can avenge the chancellor

40:55.440 --> 40:57.280
and kill the Huben Army,

40:58.640 --> 41:00.640
I will do your bidding.

41:01.600 --> 41:02.960
I'm a criminal.

41:03.960 --> 41:05.400
The general had a few men around me

41:05.480 --> 41:07.480
to prevent me from escaping.

41:09.120 --> 41:10.600
But after Commander Wang appeared

41:10.680 --> 41:12.280
and I left the city with him,

41:12.360 --> 41:14.880
they stopped appearing.

41:14.960 --> 41:17.840
That means your men in the city

41:18.440 --> 41:20.120
removed those sentries.

41:22.320 --> 41:24.520
You are indeed the smartest tactician

41:25.120 --> 41:25.960
under Yan Fengshan.

41:26.800 --> 41:29.960
The dumplings will be done soon.

41:30.040 --> 41:31.280
Have patience.

41:31.880 --> 41:33.240
Stop flattering me.

41:33.320 --> 41:34.920
I was completely outwitted by you

41:36.960 --> 41:38.560
at Hidden Soldier Alley.

41:41.640 --> 41:43.160
Then you know

41:44.880 --> 41:46.040
full well

41:46.720 --> 41:48.080
I stand as your opponent.

41:48.160 --> 41:49.800
You also know that this is a trap.

41:50.840 --> 41:51.680
Why come here at all?

41:55.240 --> 41:56.240
Why not?

41:59.000 --> 42:01.920
When I found out
you were keeping an eye on me,

42:03.120 --> 42:05.040
I couldn't wait to stand before you

42:05.120 --> 42:06.480
and see what tricks you had prepared.
